TITLE  Robotics
VERSION 170

BEGIN_GROUP Robot Exporter

BUTTON ROBOT_EXPORTER_MENU_CREATE_BUTTON
LABEL New Robot Configuration
MESSAGE Create a new Robot configuration separate from any existing ones.

BUTTON ROBOT_EXPORTER_MENU_EDIT_BUTTON
LABEL Edit and Export Robot Configuration
MESSAGE Edit the selected Robot Configuration and go through the export process.

BUTTON ROBOT_EXPORTER_MENU_LAUNCH_GUID_SANITIZER_BUTTON
LABEL GUID Sanitizer
MESSAGE Scans the current assembly or part for duplicate GUIDs for removal. GUIDs are used for retaining selections when using the Robot Exporter

BEGIN_GALLERY ROBOT_EXPORTER_TOOLS_GALLERY
GALLERY_STYLE SMALL_IMAGE_AND_TEXT
LABEL Robot Exporter Tools
CONTEXT_TITLE ROBOT_EXPORTER_TOOLS (ROBOT EXPORTER TOOLS)
COLLAPSED TRUE
COLUMN_IN_RIBBON 1
COLUMN_IN_POPUP 1
BITMAP ${UGII_USER_DIR}\application\icons\backup_128px.bmp

    BEGIN_GALLERY ROBOT_EXPORTER_TOOLS_GALLERY_LIST
    LABEL Robot Exporter Tools
    CONTEXT_TITLE Robot Exporter Tools (ROBOT EXPORTER TOOLS LIST)
    BITMAP ${UGII_USER_DIR}\application\icons\backup_128px.bmp

        BUTTON ROBOT_EXPORTER_MENU_BACKUP_BUTTON
        LABEL Back-up configuration
        MESSAGE Exports selected configuration as an .xml and .json file for import into other models or safekeeping.

        BUTTON ROBOT_EXPORTER_MENU_IMPORT_BUTTON
        LABEL Import configuration
        MESSAGE Imports backed-up configurations (.xml and .json) file into the current assembly. Note that this does not import .urdf files.

        BUTTON ROBOT_EXPORTER_MENU_DUPLICATE_BUTTON
        LABEL Duplicate configuration
        MESSAGE Duplicates the currently selected configuration into a new one.

        BUTTON ROBOT_EXPORTER_MENU_IMPORT_URDF_BUTTON
        LABEL Import URDF
        MESSAGE Imports a URDF file as a Robot Configuration and creates CSYS and Datum Axes for each link and joint. Also imports meshes (OBJ/STL).

        BUTTON ROBOT_EXPORTER_MENU_LAUNCH_GUID_DEBUGGER_BUTTON
        LABEL GUID Debugger
        MESSAGE Inspect and clear GUID attributes on selected objects

        BUTTON ROBOT_EXPORTER_MENU_LAUNCH_SUPERDEX_MESH_EXPORTER_BUTTON
        LABEL SuperDex Mesh Exporter
        MESSAGE Exports triangular meshes (via temporary STEP export), as an alternative to the standard available formats
    END_GALLERY

END_GALLERY
